外星人来吃火锅 — third-party assets

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1), via Google Fonts, subset to the characters used (tools/fonts.sh):
- ZCOOL KuaiLe (站酷快乐体) by ZCOOL — titles, signs, menu, subtitles, tags
- VT323 by Peter Hull — one numeral line on the translator screen

Code adapted (technique only) from this library's scifi-toon demo:
- toon.js (vector engine: screen-space line boil, constant line width)
- music/instr.py (theremin, analog bass, square pluck, drum machine, Karplus-Strong synthesis)
- core/audio/sfx.py helpers (library core)

Everything else — characters, sets, props, voices (formant-synthesised gibberish), score and foley — was made in code for this film.
No samples, no text-to-speech, no stock footage, no images.
